# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repo root:  E:\download\app\Check
# Tracked  :  MoreCheck/  (source, gradle wrapper, keystore)
# Ignored  :  _toolchain/, build outputs, machine-local config, credentials
# Published:  APK 走 GitHub Releases，不入库（见 README「版本回溯（Git）」）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Local toolchain (JDK 17 + Gradle 8.13 archives and extracted copies) ----
/_toolchain/

# ---- Gradle / Android build outputs ----------------------------------------
.gradle/
build/
*/build/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/

# ---- Machine-local SDK location (sdk.dir differs per machine) --------------
local.properties

# ---- 签名凭据：绝不入库 ----------------------------------------------------
# keystore.properties 含签名口令，keystore/ 含私钥。
# 两者仅本地保留，仓库外单独备份；换机器需手动带过去。
# 注意：密钥库一旦泄露，可被用于伪造同签名证书的 APK。
keystore.properties
keystore/
*.jks
*.keystore

# ---- IDE / editor ----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ---- OS --------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Logs / crash dumps / misc --------------------------------------------
*.log
*.hprof

# ---- 发布产物：APK 走 GitHub Releases，不入库 ------------------------------
# 仅忽略仓库根目录下按版本命名的归档 APK；app/build/ 已被上面的 build/ 规则忽略。
/MoreCheck/*.apk
